  "_deliberately_empty": "Entries with an empty list are words we RECOGNISE and can say NO to precisely: the concept exists in the wider field but no layer names it — no HTML element, no APG pattern, no public-service component. They resolve to NONE with a message that names the word, so the refusal is about the component and not about the vocabulary. Most of them are things the four-layer cut removed on purpose (kanban, chart, rating, stat tile, otp)."
}